{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvQ29sZCUyMENvdXJhZ2UlMjAlMjgyMDIwJTI5Lw","type":"series","name":"Cold Courage","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/4F54hdqsbPhPCO4x3sNwLgOa5fx.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eo2dMSK7r5dJJ4eHAtj7tl8SICJ.jpg","description":"Two young Finnish women in London are drawn inexorably together via the Studio - a clandestine group dedicated to bringing justice to those beyond the law. But, as their battle against exploitation, violence and corporate greed intensifies, will the Studio's ends continue to justify its means?\n\nEnded · First aired 3 May 2020 · Belgium, Finland · Language: English\nStudio: Luminoir, Potemkino, Vico Films · Network: Viaplay\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 8/8\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2020","genres":["Crime","Drama","English"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvQ29sZCUyMENvdXJhZ2UlMjAlMjgyMDIwJTI5Lw.1.1","title":"Clean Skin","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2020-05-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"In London, Mari and Lia - two women struggling from different, gloomy backgrounds - join a team of specialists. They are going to stop the power-hungry people who are trampling on justice.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8eMiU32cvEGBde0muVgENPQBxrY.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvQ29sZCUyMENvdXJhZ2UlMjAlMjgyMDIwJTI5Lw.1.2","title":"Trojan Horse","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2020-05-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The populism of British politician Arthur Fried may be linked to the Studio’s investigation into deaths with an immigrant background. One body is a Muslim boy and the other is called a faceless woman by the media.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cSkojD4kZrsB0HbkVrV3ajHne3Y.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvQ29sZCUyMENvdXJhZ2UlMjAlMjgyMDIwJTI5Lw.1.3","title":"The Faceless Women","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2020-05-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Lia's friend Nina, a sex trafficking victim, may connect to The Faceless Woman's murder. The Studio follow a possible link between Fried's campaign and a far right terror group.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3t7FmiMZ1u5MGSYQVsDbSgz20E2.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvQ29sZCUyMENvdXJhZ2UlMjAlMjgyMDIwJTI5Lw.1.4","title":"The King of East London","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2020-05-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Lia infiltrates Fried's campaign but attracts more attention than she planned. Nina leads The Studio to a house holding abused sex slaves. Mari complex family secrets catch up with her.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dDNSKj011LlEEJ6VP33p7MdfWnN.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvQ29sZCUyMENvdXJhZ2UlMjAlMjgyMDIwJTI5Lw.1.5","title":"My Father's House","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2020-05-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Mari confides dark childhood secrets to Lia, Aarne's near fatal bullying by the warped Gerber Brothers. Police find another body and Lia knows the victim. Proximity to Fried proves increasingly fatal.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fMC27uBQKwZAhA8v4sr8TgsUZMR.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvQ29sZCUyMENvdXJhZ2UlMjAlMjgyMDIwJTI5Lw.1.6","title":"Stench of Death","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2020-05-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"An interview designed to expose Fried backfires causing another woman's disappearance; kidnapped at gunpoint, Lia's violent response surprises even her.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/znaOarFCfeLBV3XGAhTY54hmjEr.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDExLTIwMjAvQ29sZCUyMENvdXJhZ2